 tool reduces the supply. Image generation is processed in the browser, while video generation is processed through a server-side AI service.\n\nHolders can stake their tokens to earn rewards paid in BNB. Staking supports lock periods of 14, 28 or 42 days, with longer locks and larger amounts increasing a staker's share of the reward pool. The staking system defines three tiers (Bronze, Silver and Gold) that apply reward multipliers and grant free AI creations within daily limits. The reward pool is funded in BNB by the project team.\n\nThe initial supply was allocated in two parts. 40,000,000 tokens (40%) were paired with BNB to provide liquidity on PancakeSwap, and the resulting liquidity-provider (LP) tokens were sent to the dead address, locking the liquidity permanently. The remaining 60,000,000 tokens (60%) are held in a separate contract referred to as the Burn Vault. This contract can send its balance to the burn address but has no function to withdraw, transfer or sell the tokens, so the reserve can only be burned.","links":[{"label":"Website","url":"https://sixsevenai.netlify.app/"},{"type":"twitter","url":"https://x.com/Sixseven_AI"},{"type":"telegram","url":"https://t.me/sixsevenaii"}],"cto":false},{"url":"https://dexscreener.com/solana/anwddzzyxxcmrybn2cuauy9djvtxa9pvnnyyd6v9pump","chainId":"solana","tokenAddress":"AnWDdzzYXXCMrYbn2cuaUy9DjvtxA9PVnNYYd6v9pump","icon":"https://cdn.dexscreener.com/cms/images/OzMZ0uQm3T_3zpIt?width=64&height=64&fit=crop&quality=95&format=auto","header":"https://cdn.dexscreener.com/cms/images/R3qbBVNw3rvFnf7q?width=600&height=200&fit=crop&quality=95&format=auto","openGraph":"https://cdn.dexscreener.com/token-images/og/solana/AnWDdzzYXXCMrYbn2cuaUy9DjvtxA9PVnNYYd6v9pump?timestamp=1792143300000","description":"Everyone thought I was paying DEX but actually I just sent a 300$ transaction to a company that lets me place a banner and update links and add a description to the coin that makes it seem just like I paid DEX","links":